      "type": "stage",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "scenedesc"
      ],
      "text": "Alarum. A retreat is sounded. Flourish. Enter, at one door, Cominius with the Romans; at another door, Martius, with his arm in a scarf.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [
        {
