      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CORIOLANUS.\nI will go wash;\nAnd when my face is fair, you shall perceive\nWhether I blush or no. Howbeit, I thank you.\nI mean to stride your steed and at all times\nTo undercrest your good addition\nTo th’ fairness of my power.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
