      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "CORIOLANUS.\nThe gods begin to mock me. I, that now\nRefused most princely gifts, am bound to beg\nOf my lord general.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
