      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "COMINIUS.\nGo we to our tent.\nThe blood upon your visage dries; ’tis time\nIt should be looked to. Come.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
